    {
      "id": "406dffb0f67d",
      "source": "Palettes",
      "target": "快捷面板",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "6e92fdcd39ba",
      "source": "Palettes are temporary windows that can be opened to quickly find or do things.",
      "target": "快捷面板是可临时打开的窗口，用于快速查找或执行操作。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "8f275c49860c",
      "source": "There are 3 palettes:",
      "target": "共有 3 种快捷面板：",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "6554669978c4",
      "source": "Command Palette:",
      "target": "Command Palette（命令面板）：",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "1e00032f293a",
      "source": "Ctrl + Return",
      "target": "Ctrl + Return",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "4e67420438ad",
      "source": " This will pop up a list of all available commands like ",
      "target": " 这会弹出所有可用命令的列表，例如 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "01d6e24d703a",
      "source": "Center Graph",
      "target": "Center Graph",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "2092d0f59a10",
      "source": " or ",
      "target": " 或 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "93500c1124f7",
      "source": "Undo",
      "target": "Undo",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "a1aa89f1e9a9",
      "source": "Parameter Palette:",
      "target": "Parameter Palette（参数面板）：",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "071490f0674b",
      "source": "Ctrl + P",
      "target": "Ctrl + P",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "a79acf6302c9",
      "source": " This will pop up a list of all available parameters like ",
      "target": " 这会弹出所有可用参数的列表，例如 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "af4632b3d7a1",
      "source": "Buoyancy",
      "target": "Buoyancy",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "50446e563a9a",
      "source": " or ",
      "target": " 或 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "3002423f7e9a",
      "source": "AO active",
      "target": "AO active",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "8c94e2a9c90b",
      "source": " which can be very useful for quickly finding parameters.",
      "target": "，这对快速查找参数很有用。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "c60b342673fa",
      "source": "Project Palette:",
      "target": "Project Palette（项目面板）：",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "7f2a38ae27b7",
      "source": "Ctrl + Shift + O",
      "target": "Ctrl + Shift + O",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "60151a481fff",
      "source": " This will pop up a list of the last 100 opened EmberGen presets which can be very useful for finding a recently opened preset that can be stored anywhere on your computer.",
      "target": " 这会弹出最近打开的 100 个 EmberGen 预设列表。对于查找最近打开过的预设很有用，因为这些预设可以存放在电脑上的任意位置。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "a88c3ee53594",
      "source": "Each one of these palettes has a search bar where you can start typing what you are looking for and the list will change based on that. To clear the text field you can use the ",
      "target": "每个快捷面板都有搜索栏。你可以开始输入要查找的内容，列表会据此变化。若要清空文本字段，可以使用右侧的 ",
      "note": "stage 3A audit fix"
    },
    {
      "id": "a6a49b700b92",
      "source": " icon on the right.",
      "target": " 图标。",
      "note": "stage 3A audit fix"
    },
    {
      "id": "6712cf413e16",
      "source": "You can select a list item by hovering over it with your mouse or using the arrow keys.",
      "target": "可以将鼠标悬停在列表项上，或使用方向键来选择列表项。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "84c5066dfdc3",
      "source": "The list items can be executed by using ",
      "target": "执行列表项时，可以使用 ",
      "note": "stage 3A audit fix"
    },
    {
      "id": "402f460aeea8",
      "source": " click or ",
      "target": " 单击或 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "68033fa483d3",
      "source": "Return",
      "target": "Return",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "0a49a2734cd1",
      "source": "To close a palette, you can either use a command, click the ",
      "target": "若要关闭快捷面板，可以使用命令、按 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "0dac590ffe17",
      "source": "Esc",
      "target": "Esc",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "290d9bbe3bdf",
      "source": " key or ",
      "target": " 键，或 ",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "eb43feb5c52b",
      "source": " click outside of it.",
      "target": " 在其外部单击。",
      "note": "stage 3A translation"
    },
    {
      "id": "ee50d15bd01d",
      "source": "Next",
      "target": "下一页",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "03fdb1d13b17",
      "source": "VDB Export",
      "target": "VDB 导出",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "da54ae61cc70",
      "source": "Previous",
      "target": "上一页",
      "note": "translation memory"
    },
    {
      "id": "88c218563a27",
